## Controlling the initial state of PSC colonies
In addition, since the colony periphery was also affected by passaging operations, we further extended the periphery length and reduced the central area by enzymatically digesting larger initial colonies into smaller ones while passaging (Fig. 5h). The changes in passaging operations to reduce colony size resulted in a PSC-to-CM
