$$
\Delta\mathrm{CHIRConcentration}(c)=\left\{\begin{array}{l l}{c-c_{1},}&{c<c_{1}}\\ {0,}&{c_{1}\leq c\leq c_{2},}\\ {c-c_{2},}&{c>c_{2}}\end{array}\right.
